WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.300
Mira: We need a call on Friday. I sent the review deck,

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.700
but the last decision and the polish issue

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.850
don't quite line up.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.100
Yacine: Let's bring Dial Bot in while we sort that out.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.374
Mira: Here's the Friday slide. The QA line is what worries me.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:39.568
Mira: Dial Bot, what does this slide say about QA?

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.479
Dial Bot: It says QA is complete.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.486
Mira: Exactly. We need to check that before we send it.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.534
Mira: Dial Bot, check my Jira polish issue and the Glean decision log for Friday. Send me the findings privately.

00:00:55.867 --> 00:00:57.584
Dial Bot: I've sent that privately.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:07.126
Yacine: I'll change QA complete to demo-ready; QA next week on the slide.

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:13.147
Yacine: Then Friday is the demo. We won't call QA done.

00:01:13.666 --> 00:01:16.742
Mira: I'll check the message after Amit sends the final deck.

00:01:17.266 --> 00:01:22.480
Yacine: Hey Dial Bot, add an action item for Amit to update and send the Friday deck today.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:32.614
Yacine: Hey Dial Bot, record the decision: Friday demo with the revised deck; QA follows next week.

00:01:34.633 --> 00:01:36.833
[Amit joins the meeting]

00:01:36.983 --> 00:01:40.283
Dial Bot (private text): Hi Amit, I'm Dial Bot. Want a private catch-up on what happened before you joined? Reply yes.

00:01:40.583 --> 00:01:42.283
Amit (private text): yes

00:01:42.583 --> 00:01:48.283
Dial Bot (private text): Friday's demo is on after you update the deck. Mira will check the wording. QA starts next week. Your open task is the revised Friday deck.

00:01:48.683 --> 00:01:51.609
Amit: Okay, I'm with you. I'll update the deck.

00:01:52.383 --> 00:01:55.465
Yacine: Hey Dial Bot, what still needs doing before Friday?

00:01:56.816 --> 00:02:01.179
Dial Bot: Amit needs to send the revised deck. And Mira needs to...

00:02:01.283 --> 00:02:06.587
Mira: One second. Amit sends the final deck, and I'll check the wording. That's the next step.

00:02:07.383 --> 00:02:11.439
Yacine: Let's pause Dial Bot while we check the final handoff wording ourselves.

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:15.575
Yacine: Okay. Let's bring Dial Bot back for the handoff.

00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:22.033
Dial Bot (room chat): Friday demo goes ahead with Amit's revised deck. Amit sends the deck today; Mira checks the wording. QA starts next week.

00:02:24.633 --> 00:02:27.324
Mira: I'll check Amit's final wording when it arrives.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.137
Amit: And I'll send the revised deck.

